ks3fs (0.3.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: in-kernel S3 filesystem as a DKMS module, with TLS,
    multipart uploads, shared writable mmap, fallocate, user xattrs and
    POSIX ACLs, O_TMPFILE and keyring credentials.

